WEBVTT

00:24.357 --> 00:25.775
You can drop us here.

00:29.988 --> 00:31.573
Thank you, Shintaro.

00:49.758 --> 00:51.425
Get ready, Escher.

00:51.426 --> 00:52.927
Okay!

01:12.906 --> 01:17.660
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

02:38.783 --> 02:40.784
That's enough! Don't use it!

02:40.785 --> 02:45.039
Don't use those powers of yours anymore,
Mumbles!

02:47.041 --> 02:48.585
You got that?!

02:54.799 --> 02:56.301
Stop!

02:56.801 --> 02:59.053
You idiot!

03:01.681 --> 03:05.434
I got him! I got the kid, Mumbles!

03:05.435 --> 03:06.561
You hear?!

03:08.646 --> 03:10.440
Can't you hear me?!

03:11.107 --> 03:14.569
Don't you dare ignore me, Crow!

03:22.869 --> 03:26.955
Bishop Dante, please help!
There's more coming!

03:26.956 --> 03:31.711
<i>Bishop Dante... Is he not helping
because he's with the enemy?</i>

03:32.378 --> 03:36.090
<i>He looks scary as well.
Could he actually be...?</i>

03:36.591 --> 03:37.967
I'm so sorry...

03:39.719 --> 03:43.722
I wish I could've helped...

03:43.723 --> 03:47.267
But my dear Renny,
your love is just too heavy for me...

03:47.268 --> 03:50.563
That's not love, it's poison!
What is wrong with this bishop?!

03:52.232 --> 03:56.736
Miss, do you know who is
behind this insurrection?

03:59.989 --> 04:01.491
Well?

04:03.159 --> 04:05.828
<i>Wh-What should I say...?</i>

04:07.705 --> 04:08.747
<i>Fine!</i>

04:08.748 --> 04:10.750
I do.

04:11.709 --> 04:14.504
The man behind this is...

04:22.887 --> 04:24.638
<i>Just as I thought.</i>

04:24.639 --> 04:27.099
<i>His Luxa is a materializing-type spell,</i>

04:27.100 --> 04:30.143
<i>but it also possesses
cleansing properties.</i>

04:30.144 --> 04:33.147
<i>The problem is what it cleanses.</i>

04:35.483 --> 04:39.152
<i>What God decides as "Evil" may not
be the same as what we think of as evil.</i>

04:39.153 --> 04:44.409
<i>So whatever this guy considers evil
will be cleansed by his Luxa...</i>

04:44.909 --> 04:48.997
<i>Normally, Fireball will never be
affected by cleansing spells.</i>

04:49.414 --> 04:52.417
<i>But if Guitane judges them to be evil...</i>

04:53.042 --> 04:55.920
<i>Then they are evil,
and they will be cleansed.</i>

04:57.005 --> 04:59.507
<i>The symbols represent what the evils are.</i>

05:00.008 --> 05:02.968
<i>I wonder what'll happen if I touch
the one with my symbol?</i>

05:02.969 --> 05:05.304
<i>Ooh, I'm so curious.</i>

05:05.305 --> 05:08.515
<i>That said, I can see it has flaws as well.</i>

05:08.516 --> 05:12.060
<i>First, it takes a couple of seconds
to create the symbols.</i>

05:12.061 --> 05:16.815
<i>Second, he cannot make a symbol of
a wide generic concept like "All sorcery."</i>

05:16.816 --> 05:23.322
<i>If he could, he wouldn't do specific ones
for fire, barrier, and divine sorcery.</i>

05:23.323 --> 05:29.328
<i>Third, all the divine sorcery symbols
were swapped with the fire symbols.</i>

05:29.329 --> 05:32.831
<i>I'm guessing he can only use
three symbols at the same time.</i>

05:32.832 --> 05:36.293
<i>He's already so interesting
with his chimera body,</i>

05:36.294 --> 05:38.920
<i>but now he's also tinkering
with God's definition,</i>

05:38.921 --> 05:43.008
<i>in other words, God's mana signature.</i>

05:43.009 --> 05:44.844
<i>Good grief, he truly is so...</i>

05:46.596 --> 05:47.972
Wepugnant!

05:51.517 --> 05:54.936
Kid, can you go
to the shelter by yourself?

05:54.937 --> 05:56.229
Yeah...

05:56.230 --> 05:58.356
But what about you...?

05:58.357 --> 06:00.859
I got some things to do.

06:00.860 --> 06:03.112
I hope you find your mom.

06:05.615 --> 06:08.451
<i>You see, Kid,
I can't leave my buddy behind.</i>

06:10.119 --> 06:12.997
What are you doing, you stupid lizard?

06:14.290 --> 06:17.251
Enough screwing around, goddammit!

06:23.299 --> 06:25.509
We evacuated everyone, Crow!

06:25.510 --> 06:28.261
It's all thanks to you!
You're the last one!

06:28.262 --> 06:30.514
I'll get you to the church
and get you...!

06:30.515 --> 06:34.643
<i>His power to turn words into reality
is just way too powerful,</i>

06:34.644 --> 06:36.646
<i>so of course it comes with a huge risk.</i>

06:37.688 --> 06:41.526
<i>Crow coughed up blood
every time he used his power.</i>

06:42.318 --> 06:46.988
<i>Anybody could see that it's too much for
him to use his power on that huge lizard.</i>

06:46.989 --> 06:51.077
<i>Every time he used it, he coughed up
a watermelon's worth of blood.</i>

06:51.828 --> 06:54.247
<i>And yet, he looked so happy...</i>

06:54.831 --> 06:57.917
<i>Happy to be using
his powers to save others...</i>

07:09.428 --> 07:11.055
What...

07:11.556 --> 07:13.141
You...

07:14.559 --> 07:16.561
Y-You're laughing...

07:17.562 --> 07:20.148
I'll friggin kill you.

07:28.072 --> 07:30.950
<i>It's laughing...</i>

07:31.492 --> 07:36.330
<i>It's been laughing all the time
at Crow's effort...</i>

07:36.998 --> 07:39.917
<i>At everything Crow's done!</i>

07:41.210 --> 07:46.132
<i>I learned so much
just from looking at him...</i>

07:46.674 --> 07:48.717
<i>Even though we only met today...</i>

07:48.718 --> 07:50.219
What's wrong...?

07:51.721 --> 07:55.183
<i>I didn't get to talk much with him...</i>

07:56.225 --> 07:59.728
<i>But I feel we're already
like real buddies...</i>

07:59.729 --> 08:01.731
Come on!

08:03.441 --> 08:05.234
Why are you going after him?!

08:05.860 --> 08:08.613
You're facing me here!

08:09.655 --> 08:10.864
Hey!

08:10.865 --> 08:14.619
He's already dead!

08:21.876 --> 08:23.376
Not yet!

08:23.377 --> 08:27.881
I can feel Crow's still alive!
Those twin bishops will heal him!

08:27.882 --> 08:29.883
<i>Crow's buddies...</i>

08:29.884 --> 08:32.844
Tao, I'm sorry to ask this
when you're tired...

08:32.845 --> 08:35.639
I'm not tired, and I'm already doing it.

08:35.640 --> 08:39.309
Don't worry, I don't sense
any civilians around here.

08:39.310 --> 08:41.269
Crow's really amazing.

08:41.270 --> 08:44.856
He protected everyone
against that humongous monster.

08:44.857 --> 08:46.816
He's incredibly strong.

08:46.817 --> 08:50.905
But even he can only stop
this monster's movement briefly.

08:51.405 --> 08:54.199
Now then, where should we start?

08:54.200 --> 08:57.327
I'll hit its butt, you get its face.

08:57.328 --> 09:00.205
I'd rather not. You get its face
while I get its rear.

09:00.206 --> 09:03.417
Nah, the face's creepy.
I'll get the butt.

09:16.097 --> 09:18.181
Hyakkaken!

09:18.182 --> 09:20.184
House of Langlis!

09:21.227 --> 09:23.062
Wheeling Dual Dragons!

09:31.862 --> 09:35.741
This dragon...
How dare it try to pull that here!

09:36.367 --> 09:38.827
I saw my life flash before my eyes again!

09:38.828 --> 09:40.997
How many times am I
going to see it today?!

09:41.372 --> 09:42.872
Tao, your hand!

09:42.873 --> 09:44.416
I'm fine.

09:44.417 --> 09:49.004
Keep your eyes on it! If we back down
here, then we'll lose everything!

09:49.005 --> 09:52.257
Everything Crow did... Everyone did...

09:52.258 --> 09:55.510
Will be for nothing thanks to this thing!

09:55.511 --> 09:57.679
<i>That dragon...</i>

09:57.680 --> 09:59.682
I'm sorry, Batts...

10:00.474 --> 10:02.767
It's too late for the boy...

10:02.768 --> 10:04.311
What...?

10:04.312 --> 10:05.771
<i>It must've realized...</i>

10:06.856 --> 10:08.441
<i>That nothing can stop it now...</i>

10:13.446 --> 10:16.032
(I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince so I Can Take
My Time Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season)

10:18.701 --> 10:22.330
<i>The moment I was born,
I immediately realized one thing.</i>

10:24.248 --> 10:26.834
<i>That I am a slave.</i>

10:29.545 --> 10:34.257
<i>My purpose in life is to carry my Master
on my back and fly where he needs to be.</i>

10:34.258 --> 10:39.012
<i>I served as loyally as a pet dog
and flew with all my might,</i>

10:39.013 --> 10:41.724
<i>all to avoid displeasing my Master.</i>

10:42.475 --> 10:46.520
<i>And after a long, long voyage
crossing the ocean...</i>

10:49.273 --> 10:51.274
How magnificent, Lord Guisarme!

10:51.275 --> 10:55.070
You mastered the power
of teleportation so quickly!

10:55.071 --> 10:59.283
<i>My Master has gained
the most powerful ability in the world.</i>

11:00.034 --> 11:04.788
<i>As terrifying as he is admirable,
such is my Master.</i>

11:04.789 --> 11:08.250
<i>Nothing can stop my Master now...</i>

11:09.293 --> 11:13.798
I don't need this dragon anymore...

11:29.397 --> 11:32.817
Sometimes getting lost
has its benefits, it seems.

11:33.401 --> 11:37.822
Since when did Lordost
become a castle for demons?

11:38.656 --> 11:40.074
In that castle...

11:42.326 --> 11:44.245
There's something vile in it...

11:44.954 --> 11:49.541
Perhaps one of those called "Demon Lords."

11:49.542 --> 11:52.044
<i>Who is that human?</i>

11:52.837 --> 11:56.215
<i>Does he not realize
he is in Lord Guisarme's territory?</i>

11:56.882 --> 12:02.470
What do you think will happen to
a Demon Lord if I cast Luma Maxima at him?

12:02.471 --> 12:07.225
Even if he is a Demon Lord, divine light
should be very effective regardless.

12:07.226 --> 12:09.478
<i>Does he not fear my Master?</i>

12:10.479 --> 12:12.856
Then what about his heart?

12:12.857 --> 12:16.610
Do you think his heart
would become pure?

12:18.988 --> 12:23.533
The answer is no.
He will not repent for it.

12:23.534 --> 12:26.745
Rather, he is not corrupted
in the first place.

12:27.538 --> 12:30.999
A monster is pure to its core.

12:31.000 --> 12:33.460
It has no guilt.

12:33.461 --> 12:37.006
Not over murder, destruction,

12:37.590 --> 12:40.050
or even betrayal.

12:41.886 --> 12:44.512
<i>It was then that I realized.</i>

12:44.513 --> 12:47.933
<i>This man will be my next master.</i>

12:57.693 --> 13:02.030
You are free to use
your chimera body as you like.

13:02.031 --> 13:05.200
<i>That is why I followed you, Guitane.</i>

13:05.201 --> 13:09.037
Perhaps you can use it
to find your true self.

13:09.038 --> 13:13.791
<i>Even if more than half of my body
has been replaced by something else,</i>

13:13.792 --> 13:18.547
<i>my clingy nature remains unchanged.</i>

13:19.048 --> 13:23.928
<i>At this point, "True self"
and "Freedom" are a mystery to me.</i>

13:24.512 --> 13:27.722
If you have no idea where to go,
how about you come with me?

13:27.723 --> 13:30.558
There's this big festival coming up.

13:30.559 --> 13:35.313
That said, I have no idea
about things as well.

13:35.314 --> 13:38.900
I've been lost for a long time.

13:38.901 --> 13:41.237
<i>I hope you find yourself one day.</i>

13:42.988 --> 13:44.281
<i>As for me...</i>

13:45.324 --> 13:47.451
<i>I'm starting to understand...</i>

13:48.744 --> 13:50.704
<i>My true self!</i>

13:52.831 --> 13:55.458
<i>It has giants' arms stitched onto it!</i>

13:55.459 --> 13:59.630
<i>This dragon is also a chimera!
Its capabilities are beyond reason!</i>

14:00.339 --> 14:01.632
Tao!

14:01.966 --> 14:03.968
She received a direct hit...

14:05.511 --> 14:07.346
House of Langlis!

14:09.223 --> 14:11.642
Twin Tiger Double Fangs!

14:21.318 --> 14:24.279
<i>Ah, so much fun!</i>

14:24.280 --> 14:26.739
<i>So gratifying!</i>

14:26.740 --> 14:29.284
Sylpha! Dammit!

14:29.285 --> 14:33.538
Come on, just do something and fix him!

14:33.539 --> 14:36.749
<i>Your faces...</i>

14:36.750 --> 14:39.043
Batts, show me your wounds!

14:39.044 --> 14:41.129
You're badly injured as well!

14:41.130 --> 14:44.592
Who cares about me?! He's a hero!

14:45.384 --> 14:48.929
<i>Your screams have shown me...</i>

14:51.265 --> 14:53.809
Where is it aiming at...?

14:56.896 --> 14:58.438
- The shelter!
- The shelter!

14:58.439 --> 15:00.273
- Don't you fricking dare!
- Don't you fricking dare!

15:00.274 --> 15:05.446
<i>That I am strong,
and more than anything, cruel!</i>

15:07.531 --> 15:08.824
<i>Now...</i>

15:09.450 --> 15:12.201
Damn it, move, my body...!

15:12.202 --> 15:17.207
<i>More, make me feel it more...</i>

15:18.876 --> 15:20.336
Please, anyone...!

15:20.961 --> 15:24.089
I don't care if you're a God
or a demon, please...!

15:24.632 --> 15:29.970
<i>Show me your despair,
and let me feel the joy of domination!</i>

15:33.974 --> 15:38.979
Somebody stop this fricking dragon!

15:57.039 --> 15:59.500
Good work hanging on, dear Bishops.

16:06.632 --> 16:08.883
Leave the rest to us.

16:08.884 --> 16:12.929
I will focus on healing this man.
You okay with that?

16:12.930 --> 16:18.644
Yeah. Make sure you save him.
Crow's our buddy.

16:19.478 --> 16:22.147
Hey, black dragon.

16:25.818 --> 16:28.904
Don't get ahead of yourself.

16:30.906 --> 16:31.823
- Who?
- Who?

16:31.824 --> 16:34.409
Err, umm, I'm...

16:34.410 --> 16:38.663
That's right! I'm the wandering
adventurer, Grimmerson!

16:38.664 --> 16:41.040
Grimmerson...

16:41.041 --> 16:44.085
<i>He has some of that
hottie vibes, though...</i>

16:44.086 --> 16:46.170
- What about those horns?
- Huh?!

16:46.171 --> 16:49.299
Uh, this is, umm, an accessory!

16:49.967 --> 16:51.927
<i>So embarrassing!</i>

16:52.636 --> 16:58.141
If you got out to help with that look,
they'll think you're a monster or chimera.

16:58.142 --> 16:59.684
G-Good point...

16:59.685 --> 17:01.894
<i>I tried transforming because of
what Jihriel said,</i>

17:01.895 --> 17:04.940
<i>but I'm bad at turning
into human form!</i>

17:06.692 --> 17:08.068
Whatever.

17:10.029 --> 17:14.157
I'm on your side. Crow will be fine.

17:14.158 --> 17:17.077
The blond... Jihridiot will fix him up.

17:17.327 --> 17:21.206
Who are you calling Jihridiot?
But yeah, I'll heal him up.

17:21.457 --> 17:24.584
If I lose even a single person
in this battle,

17:24.585 --> 17:26.795
then I will pay with my own life.

17:27.421 --> 17:28.212
Tao.

17:28.213 --> 17:30.423
Huh? How did you know my name?

17:30.424 --> 17:32.551
This area has been evacuated, right?

17:33.469 --> 17:35.137
Yeah!

17:40.350 --> 17:42.770
Then I can go all out.

17:48.233 --> 17:49.735
Hey.

17:53.322 --> 17:55.491
Stop rolling around.

17:58.744 --> 18:02.872
I heard you were laughing back there.

18:02.873 --> 18:07.752
Black dragons from the Netherworld
don't just wander into human lands.

18:07.753 --> 18:10.672
I bet someone took you
and then abandoned you.

18:11.757 --> 18:14.133
You poor creature.

18:14.134 --> 18:17.887
But don't think I'll pity you.

18:17.888 --> 18:21.516
The strong eat the weak,
that is the rule in the Netherworld.

18:21.517 --> 18:27.647
But you brought that to the human lands
and made a mess in my territory.

18:27.648 --> 18:33.653
You have no honor. You're just
a dumb mutt that got let off its leash.

18:33.654 --> 18:38.367
I'm surprised you can laugh.
I can't even be bothered to kill you.

18:40.869 --> 18:44.289
Go back to the Netherworld,
with your tails between your legs.

18:48.836 --> 18:51.463
T-That thing can fly?!

19:00.222 --> 19:02.474
<i>This demon...</i>

19:05.477 --> 19:07.980
<i>He's so kind...</i>

19:08.605 --> 19:13.443
<i>My form has turned hideous, and yet...</i>

19:13.986 --> 19:17.738
<i>He still guides me
to the path of a true dragon.</i>

19:17.739 --> 19:22.494
<i>He's even still
giving me a moment to flee.</i>

19:24.163 --> 19:27.915
<i>Thank you, but I won't run away.</i>

19:27.916 --> 19:32.254
<i>I can't run away from these emotions
that started overflowing inside me.</i>

19:33.005 --> 19:35.549
<i>I will live as a dragon...</i>

19:37.467 --> 19:39.511
<i>Or die!</i>

19:40.095 --> 19:43.974
<i>It was not the sound of joy or fear,
but the sound of pride.</i>

19:44.808 --> 19:49.271
<i>That is the sound of my cry as a dragon,
after so many years.</i>

19:52.482 --> 19:54.150
Dual incantation.

19:54.151 --> 19:57.863
Arctis Obscura Forta Magnificat!

20:08.665 --> 20:12.919
<i>Everyone had a burden to carry.</i>

20:12.920 --> 20:17.924
<i>Were they able to make peace
with themselves in this battle?</i>

20:17.925 --> 20:21.385
Lastly, please swallow this Luma Maxima.

20:21.386 --> 20:27.433
When used, your rotten body will turn
to dust, and your soul will be purified.

20:27.434 --> 20:30.269
When is this to be used?

20:30.270 --> 20:34.190
Well, perhaps when undergoing
torture you cannot withstand,

20:34.191 --> 20:36.859
or perhaps when you've
cast away all your regrets

20:36.860 --> 20:40.196
and are ready to ascend to paradise.

20:40.197 --> 20:43.325
Would that be a betrayal of me?

20:44.201 --> 20:46.452
Not at all.

20:46.453 --> 20:50.164
I am simply using you.

20:50.165 --> 20:52.959
I don't think of you as my friends.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.835
<i>Was it really true?</i>

20:54.836 --> 21:00.217
<i>At least for me, meeting you allowed me
to end my life as a dragon.</i>

21:00.759 --> 21:04.011
<i>I won't be using this crystal.</i>

21:04.012 --> 21:06.974
<i>Guitane, I will see you in hell.</i>

21:20.070 --> 21:23.781
<i>I've absorbed quite a lot of mana
since I was released.</i>

21:23.782 --> 21:25.367
<i>I'm getting stronger!</i>

21:25.993 --> 21:28.619
<i>I might even be as strong
as a Demon Lord...</i>

21:28.620 --> 21:29.996
Huh?

21:29.997 --> 21:33.250
Nah, no way. Not that far yet.

21:34.543 --> 21:36.003
In other words...

21:36.545 --> 21:40.799
I'm still nothing compared
to the kid above the clouds.

21:42.301 --> 21:45.012
Let's see how much farther we can go!

21:46.054 --> 21:48.597
Sorry, I took a while.

21:48.598 --> 21:50.516
It's okay. How's Crow?

21:50.517 --> 21:53.687
He's fine. The worst is behind him.

21:55.230 --> 21:59.109
But I'm out of mana.
I can barely move now.

22:01.820 --> 22:04.071
That should be enough help
for the surface.

22:04.072 --> 22:09.285
Yeah. I guess the best we can do
right now is to talk his ear off.

22:09.286 --> 22:11.997
Let's go above the clouds.

22:14.708 --> 22:16.752
To the final battle!

23:51.680 --> 23:56.559
<i>I'm Grimmerson, the wandering adventurer!
All major enemies have been taken care of!</i>

23:56.560 --> 23:59.103
<i>There's only the final battle
above the clouds left!</i>

23:59.104 --> 24:01.272
<i>Next time, on Episode 23:</i>

24:01.273 --> 24:02.815
<i>The Battle Above the Clouds</i>

24:02.816 --> 24:06.027
<i>You will witness the depths of sorcery.</i>
